Azec's desktop and phone presentation is adapted from MonoCode
(https://github.com/hardbeat920/monocode), MIT License, Copyright (c) 2026 Nick.
The button states and spacing are ported from src/shared/ui/SecondaryButton.tsx;
the description typography and switch geometry from SettingsView.tsx and index.css.
The Azec tile mark is adapted from MonoCode's monochrome app icon.

The interaction sounds are ported from cuelume
(https://github.com/Danilaa1/cuelume), MIT License, Copyright (c) Daniel Belyi.

